/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 149 0 R
/T (This design strengthens the chassis while allowing for personalized mounting points, cleaner wiring, and better sensor placement. The rear aero wing, absent in the BaseBot, is a notable addition. It stabilizes the bot during acceleration and directional changes, enhancing grip and reducing unwanted lift. Additionally, the improved suspension system offers smoother handling on uneven surfaces. The integration of advanced telemetry systems further aids in real-time performance monitoring.)
/E (This design strengthens the chassis while allowing for personalized mounting points, cleaner wiring, and better sensor placement. The rear aero wing, absent in the BaseBot, is a notable addition. It stabilizes the bot during acceleration and directional changes, enhancing grip and reducing unwanted lift. Additionally, the improved suspension system offers smoother handling on uneven surfaces. The integration of advanced telemetry systems further aids in real-time performance monitoring.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
