/T (We also attached an ultrasonic sensor to help the robot detect charging stations from a safe distance. It was programmed to slow down when the ultrasonic reading exceeded a certain threshold and to stop precisely for alignment. This minimized collision risks and ensured a smooth, predictable approach.)
