2430 0 obj
<<
/Title (Whenever a rewiring task was needed, we followed one strict rule: power off before touching anything. Only after disconnecting the battery did we adjust motor wires, re-route jumper cables, or correct servo placement.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2408 0 R
/Prev 2418 0 R
/Next 2431 0 R
>>
